          "snippet": {
            "text": "def Transfer (N p m : ℕ) :=\n  let C := A.levels.clock\n  (A.rep N p m).eval = (C.op m p).push (A.β N p (m+1)) (A.rep N p (m+1)).eval ∧\n  |A.β N p (m+1) - A.β N p m - G.slopeConstant*Real.log (A.S.block m).val| ≤\n    (C.params (m+1)).drift",
