            "conclusion": "`Transfer` bounds `|β(m+1) - β(m) - slopeConstant * log(block m)|` by the stage `drift`, i.e. `β_m = β_{m+1} - slope log ℓ_m + e_m` with `|e_m| ≤ drift`."
